# Notes files every pull request appends to. On a merge, keep BOTH sides' lines instead of
# stopping on a conflict (git's built-in union driver). Review the merged file afterwards:
# two edits to the same line both survive, so the old line may need deleting by hand.
PROJECT-WIREFRAME.md merge=union
HANDOFF.md merge=union
DEPLOY-LEDGER.md merge=union
